# Belt-and-braces only. Repo-only material lives in .internal/, which Cloudflare
# Pages excludes from the deployed output because the directory name starts with
# a dot. These rules are a second line of defence, not the primary mechanism —
# static files are matched before _redirects rules, so a served file wins.
/drafts/*        /404-not-served  404
/verification/*  /404-not-served  404
/.internal/*     /404-not-served  404
